{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "hermes-gateway-sa-official-v1",
    "name": "Hermes Gateway API Collection - System Analyst",
    "description": "Postman Collection resmi yang dibuat dari 0 (scratch) untuk EKSAD System Analyst Agent Gateway API (Profile `system-analyst`).\n\nBase URL: https://api-ai.eksad.com/sa\nAuth: Bearer Token (b96600cdb7d6c1b74698267ae40be861fbcea5ba1a40b0ab23bf02d60492c616)\n\nMencakup 4 Folder Utama: (1) Health & Discovery, (2) OpenAI Chat Completions API, (3) Native Stateful Session Lifecycle APIs (/api/sessions), dan (4) 5 Skenario Perancangan Dokumen System Analyst (TSD \u00a71-\u00a720, Flyway DDL PostgreSQL 7 audit columns, REST API Specs @RolesAllowed, RabbitMQ Event Schemas, dan STRIDE AppSec Threat Modeling).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
